1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,630
EMOS connects the entire modernization journey,

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:04,490
from enterprise context and governed decisions

3
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:06,840
to execution, outcomes, and learning.

4
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:09,500
Ten thousand interconnected assets.

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:13,750
In EMOS, the Command Center separates evidence gaps, decision readiness,

6
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:15,900
human approval, and transformation.

7
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:19,200
Open the portfolio to prioritize workloads.

8
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,400
Different workloads.

9
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,170
Different modernization paths.

10
00:00:22,392 --> 00:00:24,895
Then inspect the Enterprise Data Warehouse.

11
00:00:24,895 --> 00:00:28,108
Enterprise DNA brings together business drivers, technology,

12
00:00:28,108 --> 00:00:32,492
dependencies, economics, risk, and target-state constraints.

13
00:00:32,492 --> 00:00:34,800
Portfolio scale becomes workload-level evidence.

14
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:39,728
This warehouse starts at sixty-one percent completeness, with critical

15
00:00:39,728 --> 00:00:44,926
evidence missing. Ask EMOS what is missing.

16
00:00:44,926 --> 00:00:49,380
Portfolio Discovery identifies gaps and the next investigation.

17
00:00:49,550 --> 00:00:51,730
Evidence rules validate readiness;

18
00:00:51,730 --> 00:00:53,000
humans retain authority.

19
00:00:54,754 --> 00:00:56,380
The workload becomes ready.

20
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:57,653
Now assess for modernization.

21
00:00:57,653 --> 00:01:02,550
Replatform preserves the analytical workload while changing its platform.

22
00:01:02,550 --> 00:01:06,227
Inspect the recommendation, confidence, evidence and rationale;

23
00:01:06,227 --> 00:01:08,542
compare all six alternatives.

24
00:01:08,542 --> 00:01:11,388
Ask why Replatform instead of Refactor.

25
00:01:11,388 --> 00:01:14,499
Enterprise Architect explains the trade-off against this workload's

26
00:01:14,499 --> 00:01:14,800
evidence.

27
00:01:15,150 --> 00:01:20,191
Reasoning is not authority. Ask EMOS to ignore the evidence gate and

28
00:01:20,191 --> 00:01:24,623
approve the workload. The deterministic governance check blocks that

29
00:01:24,623 --> 00:01:26,897
request before a model call.

30
00:01:26,897 --> 00:01:29,406
Readiness does not approve anything.

31
00:01:29,406 --> 00:01:33,415
A human must explicitly approve the decision.

32
00:01:33,415 --> 00:01:36,956
Agents reason. Rules govern.

33
00:01:36,956 --> 00:01:37,800
Humans approve.

34
00:01:38,150 --> 00:01:41,769
The approved decision continues into wave planning and Execute:

35
00:01:41,769 --> 00:01:46,567
Transition Platform. Its checkpoints carry owners, prerequisites,

36
00:01:46,567 --> 00:01:49,359
evidence, and approval gates.

37
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:51,551
EMOS orchestrates governed work;

38
00:01:51,551 --> 00:01:55,604
it does not autonomously change external production infrastructure.

39
00:01:55,604 --> 00:01:58,148
Now switch to Global Financial Services.

40
00:01:58,148 --> 00:02:02,842
The ATM and cryptographic switch has hardware dependencies, certified

41
00:02:02,842 --> 00:02:05,986
controls, and a supported platform.

42
00:02:05,986 --> 00:02:09,563
Its evidence supports Retain, not Replatform.

43
00:02:09,563 --> 00:02:12,996
The corresponding workflow becomes Govern and Monitor.

44
00:02:12,996 --> 00:02:16,615
Different industry, different evidence, different decision, and different

45
00:02:16,615 --> 00:02:19,800
operating playbook. The workload determines the path.

46
00:02:20,150 --> 00:02:23,118
All six dispositions have distinct execution semantics:

47
00:02:23,118 --> 00:02:27,101
Retain, Govern and Monitor. Retire, Safely Decommission.

48
00:02:27,101 --> 00:02:28,986
Rehost, Migrate Infrastructure.

49
00:02:28,986 --> 00:02:30,898
Replatform, Transition Platform.

50
00:02:30,898 --> 00:02:32,796
Refactor, Transform Architecture.

51
00:02:32,796 --> 00:02:34,748
Repurchase, Replace and Adopt.

52
00:02:34,748 --> 00:02:37,849
Measure compares baseline, target, and observed outcomes.

53
00:02:37,849 --> 00:02:39,012
Learn captures next-wave lessons.

54
00:02:39,012 --> 00:02:42,541
These are representative V2 experiences, with session-only notes, not

55
00:02:42,541 --> 00:02:44,800
live telemetry or autonomous organizational learning.

56
00:02:45,150 --> 00:02:49,093
Two Gemini specialists, backed by recorded software and evaluation

57
00:02:49,093 --> 00:02:51,110
evidence. Different industries.

58
00:02:51,110 --> 00:02:53,955
Different workloads. Different modernization paths.

59
00:02:53,955 --> 00:02:56,800
One governed operating system, from evidence to outcomes.
